    "Scan of the 1981 edition of the Rising Sun, Indiana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1977; photo inspected in 1992; last revised in 1994; printed in 1994.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.9 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
